================================================================================
BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY FONTS
================================================================================
This repository bundles the Roboto Slab and Roboto typefaces, which are the
University of Nevada, Las Vegas official typefaces.

  Roboto Slab and Roboto
  Copyright the Roboto Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/roboto)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

  Files:   assets/fonts/roboto-slab-latin-var.woff2
           assets/fonts/roboto-latin-var.woff2
  Licence: assets/fonts/Roboto-Apache-License.txt

Roboto Condensed is not a separate file: the bundled Roboto is a variable
font with a width axis, and `font-stretch: 75%` renders the condensed width
from it. That saves 22 KB and one request.

Do not remove assets/fonts/Roboto-Apache-License.txt. A CI check fails if
the fonts are present and the licence is not.

The fonts are self-hosted rather than loaded from Google Fonts, so that this
site makes no third-party requests. See docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md.
